WEBVTT

00:00:15.160 --> 00:00:18.070
The upperclassmen are 
so graceful and mature!

00:00:18.070 --> 00:00:21.110
As expected from a school 
for dignified young ladies.

00:00:28.040 --> 00:00:30.780
That girl was kind of scary.

00:00:30.780 --> 00:00:33.380
I guess even Fuji Girls' has people like that.

00:00:33.700 --> 00:00:35.680
<i>Look at all those Fuji girls!</i>

00:00:36.200 --> 00:00:39.430
<i>I'll kick this ball, and you'll 
save them and move in.</i>

00:00:39.850 --> 00:00:42.310
<i>You'd better introduce 
me to them afterwards.</i>

00:00:44.840 --> 00:00:46.900
<i>Idiot! You kicked it too hard!</i>

00:00:59.110 --> 00:01:02.180
Don't go kicking balls around here!

00:01:03.360 --> 00:01:04.660
We're sorry.

00:01:05.590 --> 00:01:07.190
Are you hurt?

00:01:07.190 --> 00:01:08.750
N-No.

00:01:08.750 --> 00:01:10.940
Th-Thank you!

00:01:10.940 --> 00:01:11.750
Sure.

00:01:12.740 --> 00:01:14.150
See you later.

00:01:17.890 --> 00:01:19.230
She's so cool.

00:01:19.230 --> 00:01:21.490
She seems kind of wild, doesn't she?

00:01:21.490 --> 00:01:23.060
You're exactly right.

00:01:23.320 --> 00:01:26.700
She's the wonderfully wild girl of 
Fuji Girls', Kurahashi Riko-san.

00:01:26.700 --> 00:01:29.180
She's also known as the Wild Kid.

00:01:28.130 --> 00:01:29.840
<b>The Wild Kid</b>

00:01:29.960 --> 00:01:31.510
<b>Fujisaki Girls' Academy 
2nd Year
 Kurahashi Riko</b>

00:01:37.240 --> 00:01:39.240
The Wild Kid is so wonderful!

00:01:49.000 --> 00:01:51.180
Look, it's Maki-san.

00:01:56.800 --> 00:01:58.260
She's beautiful again today.

00:01:58.260 --> 00:02:00.010
Plus, she's the student council president

00:02:00.010 --> 00:02:02.080
and has excellent grades.

00:02:02.080 --> 00:02:03.750
I wish I could be like her.

00:02:03.750 --> 00:02:05.600
She's every bit Princess Fuji.

00:02:04.380 --> 00:02:05.620
<b>Princess Fuji</b>

00:02:05.750 --> 00:02:07.710
<b>Fujisaki Girls' Academy 
 2nd Year
Maki Natsuo</b>

00:02:13.240 --> 00:02:14.690
<i>Poor girl.</i>

00:02:14.690 --> 00:02:17.610
<i>They've given her an 
embarrassing nickname.</i>

00:02:17.220 --> 00:02:18.680
<b>Has an even more 
embarrassing nickname</b>

00:04:02.240 --> 00:04:06.160
<b>Their Remarkable Encounter</b>

00:04:04.300 --> 00:04:10.860
<i>It's already been a year since I studied
 my butt off to get into Fuji Girls',</i>

00:04:11.250 --> 00:04:12.940
<i>but I don't know...</i>

00:04:17.880 --> 00:04:19.890
Kurahashi-san, wait.

00:04:21.440 --> 00:04:24.910
Could you take this to 
the student council room?

00:04:24.910 --> 00:04:27.240
What? Why me?

00:04:27.670 --> 00:04:30.430
I just need you to make 
sure Maki-san gets this.

00:04:30.430 --> 00:04:31.540
Thanks.

00:04:32.680 --> 00:04:34.300
<i>This sucks.</i>

00:04:34.300 --> 00:04:35.460
<i>Maki, huh?</i>

00:04:37.140 --> 00:04:39.440
<i>This place is full of serious and quiet girls</i>

00:04:39.440 --> 00:04:41.960
<i>led by that super honor student.</i>

00:04:42.150 --> 00:04:43.380
<i>Oh, come on.</i>

00:04:43.380 --> 00:04:45.550
<i>It's too quiet here, even for them!</i>

00:04:45.860 --> 00:04:49.310
<i>Can't something a little exciting happen?</i>

00:04:49.640 --> 00:04:53.390
<i>Like l-love...</i>

00:04:53.390 --> 00:04:55.560
Please knock.

00:04:55.960 --> 00:05:00.020
<i>That must be it. I'm bored.</i>

00:05:18.830 --> 00:05:20.540
That was just an illusion.

00:05:20.540 --> 00:05:23.550
What's with the hug pillow 
covered in drool, then?

00:05:23.800 --> 00:05:25.510
This is a fairy.

00:05:25.720 --> 00:05:27.380
What a gross fairy.

00:05:29.090 --> 00:05:30.760
I'm done for!

00:05:30.760 --> 00:05:32.860
Someone caught me practicing kissing!

00:05:32.860 --> 00:05:33.920
Don't worry!

00:05:33.920 --> 00:05:35.660
It was so pathetic, 
I can't even make fun—

00:05:35.660 --> 00:05:39.690
Soon the whole school will know 
about this, and then the world!

00:05:39.690 --> 00:05:42.970
There will be no place left 
for me on this planet!

00:05:42.970 --> 00:05:45.920
Then, once I've been 
driven to my wit's end...

00:05:46.990 --> 00:05:48.740
Father, Mother.

00:05:48.980 --> 00:05:50.620
Forgive me for leaving this life before you.

00:05:50.620 --> 00:05:52.030
Hey, listen to me!

00:05:52.440 --> 00:05:54.240
Given the circumstances, 
I have no choice!

00:05:55.440 --> 00:05:58.040
H-Hey, what are you gonna do?

00:05:59.140 --> 00:06:03.500
Now that you know my secret, 
I cannot just let you leave.

00:06:03.570 --> 00:06:05.100
Wh-What?!

00:06:07.630 --> 00:06:09.840
You're buying me off with sweets?

00:06:12.620 --> 00:06:14.640
I won't tell anyone.

00:06:14.640 --> 00:06:15.680
What?

00:06:15.680 --> 00:06:17.060
Well, actually...

00:06:17.060 --> 00:06:20.270
I've done this kind of thing before.

00:06:21.690 --> 00:06:25.030
I've always wanted to fall in 
love, so I practice in secret.

00:06:25.220 --> 00:06:27.820
Do you understand how I feel?

00:06:27.820 --> 00:06:28.860
Yeah!

00:06:28.860 --> 00:06:31.070
Will you help me, then?

00:06:31.070 --> 00:06:32.100
Yeah!

00:06:32.250 --> 00:06:33.280
Huh?

00:06:39.370 --> 00:06:41.480
The meeting is essential to love!

00:06:41.480 --> 00:06:44.500
We'll practice running into 
people correctly at corners.

00:06:44.500 --> 00:06:46.910
<i>It's so clichéd, it's almost refreshing.</i>

00:06:47.080 --> 00:06:48.050
Here we go!

00:06:48.050 --> 00:06:49.220
Okay, okay.

00:06:55.290 --> 00:06:56.540
<i>This is stupid...</i>

00:06:56.540 --> 00:06:57.220
Hey!

00:06:59.950 --> 00:07:02.070
We can't make a connection 
if you avoid me.

00:07:02.070 --> 00:07:04.770
That's not a connection, 
it's a collision!

00:07:04.770 --> 00:07:07.480
I thought a forceful collision
 would be more memorable.

00:07:07.480 --> 00:07:09.740
You'll hit them so hard, 
they'll lose their memory.

00:07:09.940 --> 00:07:12.060
Keep the intensity at a reasonable level.

00:07:12.060 --> 00:07:12.970
Okay.

00:07:12.970 --> 00:07:14.820
Let's go, then.

00:07:18.370 --> 00:07:20.840
Are you trying to start a relationship or a fight?

00:07:20.840 --> 00:07:23.630
You misunderstand! According to my plan...

00:07:24.220 --> 00:07:25.400
We collide,

00:07:25.400 --> 00:07:27.280
my hair gets stuck in his button,

00:07:27.500 --> 00:07:29.680
and he untangles it for me.

00:07:29.680 --> 00:07:31.740
<i>Your hair is so silky.</i>

00:07:31.740 --> 00:07:34.010
Even though it's tangled in his button?

00:07:35.140 --> 00:07:39.220
Don't be greedy or overdramatic. Act naturally.

00:07:39.220 --> 00:07:40.800
I mean, come on. You're pretty—

00:07:41.690 --> 00:07:42.850
Pretty?

00:07:45.240 --> 00:07:46.500
Pretty weird.

00:07:46.500 --> 00:07:47.820
Weird?!

00:07:48.140 --> 00:07:52.250
You may be harsh, Kurahashi-san, 
but you're very informative.

00:07:52.250 --> 00:07:54.620
Are you a master of love?

00:07:54.870 --> 00:07:55.780
Huh?

00:07:55.890 --> 00:07:57.810
<b>Riko: 6 Years Old</b>

00:07:58.010 --> 00:08:00.070
I like the girl on the right.

00:08:00.540 --> 00:08:02.540
Riko, it'll be our secret.

00:08:00.540 --> 00:08:02.770
<b>Riko: 11 Years Old</b>

00:08:02.540 --> 00:08:05.510
I like your friend Noriko.

00:08:06.420 --> 00:08:08.650
<b>Riko: 13 Years Old</b>

00:08:06.420 --> 00:08:08.940
You don't really seem like a girl.

00:08:07.610 --> 00:08:10.690
<b>Popular?</b>

00:08:07.830 --> 00:08:12.800
<b>Former Classmates</b>

00:08:08.940 --> 00:08:11.410
I'm glad I don't have to worry about liking you.

00:08:11.410 --> 00:08:12.800
Y-Yeah.

00:08:12.800 --> 00:08:14.800
<b>Present Riko: 14 Years Old</b>

00:08:15.020 --> 00:08:16.240
Kurahashi-san?

00:08:16.420 --> 00:08:20.920
W-Well, yeah! I've had a 
few boyfriends, of course.

00:08:20.920 --> 00:08:21.810
I knew it!

00:08:22.070 --> 00:08:24.770
I hope you'll continue to help me.

00:08:24.770 --> 00:08:25.930
Sure.

00:08:26.980 --> 00:08:28.980
<b>After School the Next Day</b>

00:08:29.810 --> 00:08:31.740
That's it for today.

00:08:31.740 --> 00:08:32.820
Hey, Riko.

00:08:33.700 --> 00:08:35.370
Get out of the way!

00:08:37.540 --> 00:08:38.410
Look at this.

00:08:38.410 --> 00:08:40.400
<b>Notice
 As of today, Kurahashi Riko of Class 
2-3 is the student council president's aide.</b>
 Student Council President 
Maki Natsuo

00:08:40.410 --> 00:08:42.870
I didn't think you'd join 
the student council.

00:08:43.830 --> 00:08:45.850
What is that about?!

00:08:45.850 --> 00:08:46.790
Welcome.

00:08:46.790 --> 00:08:49.660
Why do I have to do this?

00:08:49.660 --> 00:08:52.170
That hurts, Kurahashi-san.

00:08:52.170 --> 00:08:53.480
Why, you...

00:08:53.740 --> 00:08:55.140
Unbelievable.

00:08:55.280 --> 00:08:58.140
Y-You don't have to do any work.

00:08:58.700 --> 00:09:01.560
I just wanted to talk to you some more.

00:09:01.810 --> 00:09:03.270
Is that all right?

00:09:05.280 --> 00:09:07.150
I mean, it's not that I won't do it...

00:09:07.150 --> 00:09:08.370
Good!

00:09:08.370 --> 00:09:11.130
In that case, let's practice 
romantic ways to hold hands.

00:09:11.130 --> 00:09:12.680
I think I'll pass, after all.

00:09:12.680 --> 00:09:13.990
Request denied!

00:09:15.400 --> 00:09:18.540
Just don't make me the student 
council president's aide.

00:09:18.540 --> 00:09:21.270
I'll keep helping you with your love practice.

00:09:21.550 --> 00:09:22.650
No.

00:09:22.650 --> 00:09:24.400
Since we'll practice in this room,

00:09:24.400 --> 00:09:26.750
you must be a member 
of the student council.

00:09:26.750 --> 00:09:29.560
If we carelessly let someone 
see you leaving this room,

00:09:29.560 --> 00:09:32.100
my image would be ruined!

00:09:31.100 --> 00:09:33.310
We went into the hallway just yesterday.

00:09:33.640 --> 00:09:35.220
How careless of me!

00:09:35.650 --> 00:09:38.750
<i>Does this girl really need 
to practice falling in love?</i>

00:09:38.750 --> 00:09:40.240
<i>She's good-looking and smart.</i>

00:09:40.240 --> 00:09:42.060
<i>What could she be missing?</i>

00:09:42.060 --> 00:09:45.250
It's your fault in the first place, Kurahashi-san.

00:09:45.250 --> 00:09:46.090
What?

00:09:46.090 --> 00:09:49.910
It's your fault for 
catching me kissing Huggy.

00:09:49.910 --> 00:09:51.650
<i>I guess what she's missing is naming sense.</i>

00:09:51.650 --> 00:09:54.680
By the way, I painted him with 
my ideal boyfriend in mind.

00:09:54.680 --> 00:09:56.280
<i>She's not very artistic, either.</i>

00:09:56.280 --> 00:09:59.240
I'm sorry I caught you, 
but it wasn't on purpose.

00:09:59.240 --> 00:10:01.450
Besides, you shouldn't be 
doing that with a hug pillow.

00:10:01.450 --> 00:10:02.540
What?

00:10:02.540 --> 00:10:05.080
But Kurahashi-san, you said 
you practiced kissing before.

00:10:05.080 --> 00:10:07.960
Th-That was a long time ago.

00:10:07.960 --> 00:10:10.610
I see, you're a master of love.

00:10:10.610 --> 00:10:13.460
There's no need for you to 
practice kissing anymore.

00:10:13.460 --> 00:10:14.490
<i>Gulp!</i>

00:10:20.490 --> 00:10:23.100
I-It was a hot summer day...

00:10:24.530 --> 00:10:26.730
Amazing! Amazing!

00:10:26.990 --> 00:10:28.080
Please, Master.

00:10:28.080 --> 00:10:30.730
Please try holding hands with me!

00:10:30.730 --> 00:10:32.820
O-Okay.

00:10:33.910 --> 00:10:36.110
Let's hold hands like we've
 dated for two weeks,

00:10:36.110 --> 00:10:40.330
we started as friends, and we're
 too shy to act like lovers.

00:10:40.330 --> 00:10:41.910
That's specific.

00:10:43.620 --> 00:10:46.260
I can't believe we're going out.

00:10:46.260 --> 00:10:48.180
<i>You're starting there?!</i>

00:10:48.180 --> 00:10:50.430
Do you remember that day at the beach?

00:10:50.430 --> 00:10:51.760
Who cares?

00:10:51.760 --> 00:10:52.600
You're so mean!

00:10:52.600 --> 00:10:54.840
That's where our love first blossomed!

00:10:53.460 --> 00:10:54.840
Again, who cares?!

00:10:54.840 --> 00:10:56.280
You won't even hold my hand.

00:10:56.280 --> 00:10:58.480
You don't understand how girls feel!

00:10:58.480 --> 00:10:59.550
You're worthless!

00:11:00.490 --> 00:11:03.550
<b>Now understands how men
 feel when pushed around 
by sentimental women</b>

00:11:03.550 --> 00:11:05.900
You don't need to do all that acting!

00:11:05.900 --> 00:11:08.630
I-I thought it would put us 
in the right mindset.

00:11:08.630 --> 00:11:10.430
Besides, the mood is important.

00:11:10.430 --> 00:11:11.480
The mood?

00:11:11.840 --> 00:11:13.340
We're doing the same thing either way!

00:11:13.340 --> 00:11:14.610
Give me your hand!

00:11:16.380 --> 00:11:22.720
<b>Understands how men feel again...</b>

00:11:18.690 --> 00:11:20.510
I'm strangely shocked.

00:11:20.970 --> 00:11:22.120
Me, too.

00:11:22.850 --> 00:11:24.490
<b>Second Try</b>

00:11:29.400 --> 00:11:31.460
Ow!

00:11:31.460 --> 00:11:34.600
Was this supposed to be a self-defense class?

00:11:34.600 --> 00:11:36.060
I'm sorry.

00:11:36.410 --> 00:11:40.130
I thought a little mischief 
would make me seem cuter.

00:11:41.960 --> 00:11:45.510
I had no idea holding 
hands was so dangerous.

00:11:45.510 --> 00:11:48.350
You think I'll let you break my 
fingers every time we hold hands?

00:11:48.560 --> 00:11:51.900
Kurahashi-san, what was it like when 
you first held hands with your boyfriend?

00:11:51.900 --> 00:11:52.580
What?!

00:11:52.580 --> 00:11:54.700
W-Well, uh...

00:11:56.300 --> 00:11:58.540
I'll tell you when I come tomorrow!

00:11:58.540 --> 00:11:59.260
Okay.

00:11:59.260 --> 00:12:00.670
I'll see you here again tomorrow.

00:12:01.080 --> 00:12:02.650
Wait, forget I said that!

00:12:02.950 --> 00:12:05.030
No way. I'll see you tomorrow.

00:12:06.510 --> 00:12:09.000
<b>Kurahashi Riko: Student Council President's Aide</b>

00:12:10.090 --> 00:12:13.610
<i>Student council president, 
Maki Natsuo, is super talented.</i>

00:12:13.910 --> 00:12:16.090
<i>She manages all kinds of projects.</i>

00:12:16.230 --> 00:12:18.320
<i>She keeps tabs on all the clubs.</i>

00:12:18.520 --> 00:12:20.180
<i>She handles the student meetings.</i>

00:12:20.360 --> 00:12:22.020
<i>She negotiates with teachers.</i>

00:12:22.470 --> 00:12:26.200
<i>She performs a mountain of 
tasks precisely and promptly.</i>

00:12:26.200 --> 00:12:28.430
<i>She's a super middle school girl.</i>

00:12:30.130 --> 00:12:32.680
<i>I know I'm her aide in name only, but...</i>

00:12:32.940 --> 00:12:34.020
<i>Okay.</i>

00:12:34.020 --> 00:12:36.460
Hey, do you need any help?

00:12:36.460 --> 00:12:37.270
What?

00:12:37.270 --> 00:12:39.540
No, it's fine. Don't worry.

00:12:39.540 --> 00:12:40.650
Yeah, but...

00:12:41.110 --> 00:12:45.240
After all, I'm just 
summarizing our love research.

00:12:45.550 --> 00:12:47.730
That's not work!

00:12:47.730 --> 00:12:50.590
By the way, what are the other 
student council members doing?

00:12:50.590 --> 00:12:53.370
You should at least make the 
vice president help you.

00:12:53.660 --> 00:12:55.370
I can't do that.

00:12:56.150 --> 00:12:57.380
Why not?

00:12:57.560 --> 00:13:00.120
Because I'm the vice president as well.

00:13:00.120 --> 00:13:01.000
What?

00:13:01.280 --> 00:13:03.410
I used to be the vice president,

00:13:03.410 --> 00:13:06.340
assisting a third-year student 
acting as the president, but...

00:13:07.770 --> 00:13:10.030
Is there any work for me?

00:13:10.030 --> 00:13:12.360
Oh, I did all of it already.

00:13:12.360 --> 00:13:13.380
I see.

00:13:13.380 --> 00:13:15.040
Well, there was that matter
 from the other day—

00:13:15.040 --> 00:13:17.140
I took care of that, as well.

00:13:17.480 --> 00:13:19.920
I think a teacher asked me to—

00:13:19.030 --> 00:13:20.730
I already did everything.

00:13:20.730 --> 00:13:23.980
Why don't you be the president, then?!

00:13:26.180 --> 00:13:28.450
It's all because I'm so talented.

00:13:28.450 --> 00:13:30.950
She's got problems too, 
but you're not without yours.

00:13:30.950 --> 00:13:36.190
And the treasurer was excellent 
when it came to money, but...

00:13:37.230 --> 00:13:38.440
Box...

00:13:39.750 --> 00:13:41.420
Is that our budget for the semester?

00:13:41.790 --> 00:13:47.440
PlaceStation 4... Ninjindo GS... iBat...

00:13:50.020 --> 00:13:53.310
She kind of scared me, so 
I told her not to come here.

00:13:53.310 --> 00:13:55.740
Isn't there anyone normal?

00:13:55.740 --> 00:13:58.020
The first-year secretary is a nice girl.

00:13:58.270 --> 00:14:02.480
She's very shy, so I've never 
really seen her, though.

00:14:02.480 --> 00:14:04.990
Does she actually exist?

00:14:04.990 --> 00:14:05.870
Yes.

00:14:05.870 --> 00:14:09.460
Completed paperwork will sometimes 
appear in front of the door,

00:14:09.780 --> 00:14:11.700
or the room will be cleaned.

00:14:11.700 --> 00:14:14.160
You sure she's not a fairy?

00:14:14.310 --> 00:14:17.400
In any case, I'm able to 
do most things by myself,

00:14:17.400 --> 00:14:18.870
so I don't see a problem.

00:14:18.870 --> 00:14:20.180
It <i>is</i> a problem.

00:14:20.180 --> 00:14:22.440
I accept that you're talented,

00:14:22.440 --> 00:14:25.670
but what happens when you take on 
too much alone and break down?

00:14:25.670 --> 00:14:27.110
Kurahashi-san...

00:14:27.880 --> 00:14:30.790
Gosh, did you say I'm talented?

00:14:30.790 --> 00:14:31.750
Say it some more.

00:14:31.750 --> 00:14:34.100
You've got a pretty nasty 
personality, don't you?

00:14:34.100 --> 00:14:40.400
Anyway, boys seem like they'd avoid 
a girl who does everything perfectly.

00:14:41.440 --> 00:14:45.230
If you don't do clumsy things sometimes, 
you won't get any boys.

00:14:46.720 --> 00:14:48.450
<i>That worked too well!</i>

00:14:48.450 --> 00:14:50.410
<b>The Next Day</b>

00:14:50.410 --> 00:14:53.450
Oh, this is terrible!

00:14:54.110 --> 00:14:56.410
I'm so clumsy!

00:14:56.410 --> 00:14:58.120
<i>That seems intentional.</i>

00:14:58.120 --> 00:15:02.080
I accidentally handed out the 
wrong papers to the entire school!

00:15:02.080 --> 00:15:03.340
<i>Yeah, yeah...</i>

00:15:04.320 --> 00:15:06.760
I mixed it up with my love lab notes...

00:15:08.260 --> 00:15:11.470
You're always so quick, Maki-san.

00:15:08.280 --> 00:15:11.450
Love Lab Results

00:15:12.020 --> 00:15:14.520
W-We've discovered a serious error!

00:15:14.520 --> 00:15:16.140
We're recalling these!

00:15:19.680 --> 00:15:21.480
Sorry for the trouble.

00:15:22.520 --> 00:15:24.560
You really are quick.

00:15:24.560 --> 00:15:27.620
Thank goodness they hadn't read them yet!

00:15:28.170 --> 00:15:30.530
If you're gonna cry about it, 
don't do it in the first place!

00:15:30.530 --> 00:15:33.700
You idiot, I'm gonna...

00:15:34.010 --> 00:15:36.080
You were right, Kurahashi-san.

00:15:37.620 --> 00:15:39.870
I sometimes make mistakes on my own.

00:15:39.870 --> 00:15:43.170
That's why I need someone 
to correct them for me.

00:15:43.170 --> 00:15:44.630
Maki...

00:15:47.000 --> 00:15:49.260
You can't fool me!

00:15:49.260 --> 00:15:50.980
I'm sorry!

00:15:52.030 --> 00:15:52.880
Ahem.

00:15:52.880 --> 00:15:54.380
Let's start over.

00:15:54.380 --> 00:15:57.540
The topic of today's love 
practice is "encounters."

00:15:57.540 --> 00:15:59.520
We did that before.

00:16:00.680 --> 00:16:03.070
That was certainly wonderful,

00:16:03.070 --> 00:16:05.980
but it's only usable in the morning,
 which is a critical shortcoming.

00:16:05.980 --> 00:16:08.190
I'm not sure it's even usable in the morning.

00:16:08.440 --> 00:16:10.280
Therefore, this time we'll practice...

00:16:10.280 --> 00:16:13.780
Operation: Drop a Handkerchief 
and Have It Picked Up!

00:16:13.780 --> 00:16:16.490
Wow. That's a classic.

00:16:16.490 --> 00:16:19.180
I will start by casually 
dropping my handkerchief.

00:16:19.180 --> 00:16:20.200
Huggy again?

00:16:20.200 --> 00:16:22.510
<i>Hey, you. You dropped your handkerchief.</i>

00:16:22.510 --> 00:16:25.100
When I hear him call to me, I will... run away!

00:16:25.100 --> 00:16:26.840
What happened to doing things casually?

00:16:26.840 --> 00:16:29.120
We'll innocently run through the city together.

00:16:29.120 --> 00:16:31.420
Huggy's happy to go along 
with anything, isn't he?

00:16:31.420 --> 00:16:33.970
Before we know it, we're in a 
field of flowers on the cape.

00:16:33.090 --> 00:16:33.970
Where <i>is</i> that?!

00:16:33.970 --> 00:16:36.340
<i>Natsuo, I finally caught you.</i>

00:16:36.340 --> 00:16:38.390
<i>I love you. I truly love you.</i>

00:16:38.390 --> 00:16:39.800
<i>I love you, too!</i>

00:16:39.800 --> 00:16:41.330
<i>I'll never let you go.</i>

00:16:41.330 --> 00:16:42.520
Hold up!

00:16:42.520 --> 00:16:45.230
Okay, first, you need to 
move away from that fantasy!

00:16:45.230 --> 00:16:47.730
Why would you suddenly run away, anyway?

00:16:47.730 --> 00:16:51.720
Simply accepting the handkerchief 
won't lead to romance.

00:16:51.890 --> 00:16:55.570
But if I run away, love might 
blossom while he's chasing me.

00:16:57.520 --> 00:17:00.250
What are you expecting from 
someone you've never met before?

00:17:00.250 --> 00:17:03.330
Besides, you'll piss him off 
if you run away, and it's rude.

00:17:03.330 --> 00:17:05.580
You're right. If it's obvious 
that I'm running away...

00:17:06.070 --> 00:17:07.170
That's it.

00:17:07.170 --> 00:17:09.780
I must be as elegant as a swan,

00:17:09.780 --> 00:17:12.410
while moving as quickly as 
I can beneath the surface.

00:17:12.410 --> 00:17:13.260
Well?

00:17:13.260 --> 00:17:14.510
You're not hidden under anything!

00:17:14.760 --> 00:17:17.000
Come on, chase me.

00:17:17.000 --> 00:17:18.360
No. That's creepy.

00:17:18.360 --> 00:17:19.480
Why?

00:17:19.480 --> 00:17:20.970
Stay away from me!

00:17:20.970 --> 00:17:24.710
A-Are you sure you're not stupid?

00:17:24.710 --> 00:17:26.850
Do you normally use a body double?

00:17:26.850 --> 00:17:28.190
You're so mean.

00:17:28.360 --> 00:17:30.460
H-How rude.

00:17:30.460 --> 00:17:35.690
I'm always using my talented mind to 
think of ways to handle any situation.

00:17:36.010 --> 00:17:38.350
I am a kind and simple girl

00:17:36.070 --> 00:17:38.360
See? Look at the back.

00:17:38.550 --> 00:17:40.660
That reads like some kind of questionable ad.

00:17:40.660 --> 00:17:44.400
<b>P.S. This handkerchief
 is full of memories
 of my grandmother...</b>

00:17:41.410 --> 00:17:44.410
The postscript in the bottom 
corner is the key point.

00:17:44.410 --> 00:17:46.490
What a creepy strategy.

00:17:46.490 --> 00:17:48.150
My grandmother is very healthy.

00:17:48.150 --> 00:17:49.340
Now it's a scam!

00:17:49.340 --> 00:17:52.140
Oh, come on. Don't use this handkerchief.

00:17:52.140 --> 00:17:54.670
It's dangerous to advertise your 
personal information like that.

00:17:56.000 --> 00:17:58.430
<i>How is this girl talented?</i>

00:17:58.430 --> 00:18:00.060
We'll continue this tomorrow.

00:18:00.060 --> 00:18:01.010
Yes!

00:18:03.750 --> 00:18:04.920
Riko!

00:18:06.010 --> 00:18:07.980
Mika, are you headed home, too?

00:18:07.980 --> 00:18:12.560
Yeah, but I still can't believe 
you're on the student council.

00:18:12.560 --> 00:18:14.110
Shut up, idiot!

00:18:17.070 --> 00:18:18.560
Well, see you tomorrow.

00:18:18.560 --> 00:18:20.270
Yeah, see you.

00:18:20.270 --> 00:18:22.140
You too, student council president!

00:18:24.920 --> 00:18:26.660
Sorry to hold you up.

00:18:26.900 --> 00:18:30.420
Do people always call you Riko?

00:18:30.680 --> 00:18:32.710
Yeah, my friends do.

00:18:34.550 --> 00:18:37.920
I-In that case, perhaps I 
should also call you Riko...

00:18:38.150 --> 00:18:40.250
I mean, Riko-chan...

00:18:40.250 --> 00:18:41.140
No...

00:18:41.140 --> 00:18:43.430
R-Riko-pin!

00:18:43.430 --> 00:18:44.680
Am I a nutrient?

00:18:47.060 --> 00:18:48.520
I-I'm sorry.

00:18:48.520 --> 00:18:49.890
Just call me Riko.

00:18:52.780 --> 00:18:54.730
Yes, Riko!

00:18:54.980 --> 00:18:58.020
Y-You can call me Natsuo—

00:18:58.020 --> 00:18:59.250
No, I'll call you Maki.

00:18:59.250 --> 00:19:00.410
What?!

00:19:00.640 --> 00:19:03.170
It's easier to say.

00:19:03.170 --> 00:19:04.730
But...

00:19:05.180 --> 00:19:07.100
<b>The Next Day</b>

00:19:07.120 --> 00:19:08.290
Kurahashi-san.

00:19:09.540 --> 00:19:11.680
Wearing another garish hairband, I see.

00:19:11.680 --> 00:19:14.400
You know decorative ones are 
against the school dress code.

00:19:14.400 --> 00:19:15.740
Sorry.

00:19:15.740 --> 00:19:17.790
Your skirt is a little too short, too.

00:19:17.790 --> 00:19:20.880
You're on the student council. 
You should learn from Maki-san.

00:19:20.880 --> 00:19:24.050
I-I don't think I can do that...

00:19:24.890 --> 00:19:26.510
I really don't...

00:19:26.510 --> 00:19:28.400
You mustn't give up so easily!

00:19:28.400 --> 00:19:31.760
In any case, you should dress in a 
dignified manner befitting of our school.

00:19:31.760 --> 00:19:34.190
Who cares if I dress up a little?

00:19:34.190 --> 00:19:36.400
I'm sure Maki wants to dress up, too.

00:19:37.180 --> 00:19:39.860
Maki-san isn't like you.

00:19:41.790 --> 00:19:45.580
<i>I know Maki's a top student, 
but how is she different from me?</i>

00:19:46.060 --> 00:19:48.290
<i>She's just like me on the inside.</i>

00:19:49.450 --> 00:19:54.400
Riko, let's study ways to make the 
back of our necks look attractive!

00:19:54.400 --> 00:19:56.340
<i>Okay, we're completely different.</i>

00:20:00.990 --> 00:20:03.460
Oh? You didn't tie your hair up today—

00:20:03.460 --> 00:20:05.300
Who cares about that?

00:20:05.500 --> 00:20:06.840
But you usually...

00:20:07.440 --> 00:20:09.990
Perhaps you're focused on the nape, as well—

00:20:09.990 --> 00:20:11.270
Ow, ow, ow...

00:20:11.270 --> 00:20:13.220
It doesn't matter, got it?

00:20:13.450 --> 00:20:15.820
That hurts!

00:20:15.820 --> 00:20:16.680
<i>Oh, no.</i>

00:20:16.680 --> 00:20:18.400
<i>It's not Maki's fault.</i>

00:20:19.510 --> 00:20:21.780
So, what's this about necks?

00:20:21.780 --> 00:20:25.780
I heard men get excited when they 
see the back of a woman's neck.

00:20:25.780 --> 00:20:29.200
So I thought we could come up with 
effective ways to show off the nape.

00:20:29.200 --> 00:20:31.440
Just tie your hair up like you would normally.

00:20:31.440 --> 00:20:32.980
Normally?

00:20:32.980 --> 00:20:34.870
Very well, I'll give it a shot.

00:20:35.630 --> 00:20:37.340
I don't have anything to tie my hair.

00:20:37.580 --> 00:20:39.370
Oh, I've got...

00:20:45.840 --> 00:20:50.310
I've never had a friend tie my hair
 for me before. I'm so happy.

00:20:50.310 --> 00:20:54.230
Besides, I'd been thinking 
your hairbands were cute.

00:20:56.130 --> 00:20:58.020
<i>Hear that, Sensei?</i>

00:20:59.560 --> 00:21:00.960
There, done.

00:21:03.840 --> 00:21:05.180
Is it cute?

00:21:05.180 --> 00:21:06.580
Yeah, it's cute.

00:21:06.580 --> 00:21:08.550
Does looking at my nape excite you?

00:21:08.550 --> 00:21:09.700
Yeah, it does.

00:21:10.450 --> 00:21:12.410
Listen, Riko.

00:21:13.500 --> 00:21:16.750
Thank you for joining the student council.

00:21:18.340 --> 00:21:21.170
A-Anyway, what are you going to do now?

00:21:21.420 --> 00:21:23.940
We're going to continue 
practicing love, of course.

00:21:23.940 --> 00:21:26.350
In order to show off my neck, I should...

00:21:26.820 --> 00:21:28.010
...do this!

00:21:28.240 --> 00:21:31.470
If I do this, you can see 
it clearly from every angle.

00:21:31.720 --> 00:21:33.060
Yeah, I see it...

00:21:33.060 --> 00:21:34.330
How is it, Riko?

00:21:34.330 --> 00:21:36.330
Does my nape look good?

00:21:36.330 --> 00:21:37.790
Is it shining?

00:21:37.790 --> 00:21:39.950
Yeah, it looks good.

00:21:39.950 --> 00:21:41.520
You're spinning too fast
 for me to see, though.

00:21:42.190 --> 00:21:44.110
Hey, are you okay?

00:21:45.220 --> 00:21:47.250
I feel sick.

00:21:47.250 --> 00:21:48.240
Are you stupid?!

00:21:48.450 --> 00:21:53.000
If those girls who look up to you 
could see you now, they'd cry.

00:21:53.670 --> 00:21:55.540
If that ever happened...

00:21:56.540 --> 00:21:58.820
I'd cry first.

00:22:04.990 --> 00:22:07.470
I-I'm sorry.

00:22:07.790 --> 00:22:09.100
Hey, wait!

00:22:09.900 --> 00:22:12.860
Was that the first-year secretary?

00:22:12.860 --> 00:22:15.100
That's a fairy.

00:22:15.410 --> 00:22:17.270
That was a fairy.

00:22:18.150 --> 00:22:20.340
Don't run from reality!

00:22:20.340 --> 00:22:22.110
Come back! Come back to me!

00:22:22.400 --> 00:22:24.200
Maki!

00:23:57.850 --> 00:24:03.570
<b>Preview</b>

00:23:58.900 --> 00:23:59.860
<i>Riko,</i>

00:23:59.860 --> 00:24:02.790
<i>I think the first time is 
important in almost everything.</i>

00:24:02.790 --> 00:24:04.170
<i>What's gotten into you, Maki?</i>

00:24:04.170 --> 00:24:05.290
<i>Exactly that!</i>

00:24:05.290 --> 00:24:08.990
<i>I want you to call me by 
my first name, Natsuo.</i>

00:24:08.990 --> 00:24:09.840
<i>What?</i>

00:24:09.840 --> 00:24:11.560
<i>If it's difficult for you to say Natsuo,</i>

00:24:11.560 --> 00:24:14.980
<i>you could call me something 
cute like Nacchan or Natsu.</i>

00:24:15.620 --> 00:24:18.010
<i>In that case, I'll take the "o" 
from Natsuo and call you...</i>

00:24:18.420 --> 00:24:19.340
<i>Old Man.</i>

00:24:19.900 --> 00:24:20.700
<i>Call me Maki.</i>

00:24:20.700 --> 00:24:21.610
<i>But...</i>

00:24:21.610 --> 00:24:22.720
<i>Call me Maki.</i>

00:24:23.380 --> 00:24:24.950
<i>Yes, Maki-san.</i>

00:24:23.960 --> 00:24:27.150
<b>The Shy, the Cool, and the Perverted?</b>

00:24:27.150 --> 00:24:30.220
<b>Don't miss the next episode!</b>
